0M Bpifrance France 2030 subsidy. No company/official primary source read.", "url": "https://www.usinenouvelle.com/article/dans-le-nouveau-nucleaire-le-francais-hexana-veut-doubler-l-americain-terra-power-avec-un-amr-thermique.N2204373"}, {"org": "blue-capsule-technology", "name": "France 2030 – BLUE CAPSULE", "body": "Bpifrance (France 2030)", "amt": 10000000, "d": "2023-11-27", "prog": "AAP « Réacteurs nucléaires innovants » (France 2030)", "desc": "France 2030 support for project BLUE CAPSULE. Aid type: grant (subvention, Bpifrance) — 'up to' ceiling. Confidence: medium. Source quote: \"bénéficiant ainsi d'une subvention pouvant aller jusqu'à 10M€…\" Notes: Partner (Egis) press release; amount is a maximum ('pouvant aller jusqu'à'). Reactor is a 150 MWth high-temperature sodium-pool / air-cooled design (not molten salt).", "url": "https://www.egis-group.com/fr/actualites/blue-capsule-laureat-de-l-appel-a-projets-reacteurs-nucleaires-innovants-du-plan-d-investissement-france-2030"}, {"org": "stellaria", "name": "France 2030 – STELLARIUM", "body": "Bpifrance (France 2030)", "amt": 10000000, "d": "2024-03-21", "prog": "AAP « Réacteurs nucléaires innovants » (France 2030)", "desc": "France 2030 support for project STELLARIUM. Aid type: grant (subvention, non-dilutive). Confidence: high. Source quote: \"Chaque consortium se voit attribuer 10 M€ de subvention par l'Etat français…\"", "url": "https://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20240325849615/fr"}, {"org": "thorizon", "name": "France 2030 – PROXIMA", "body": "Bpifrance (France 2030)", "amt": 10000000, "d": "2024-03-21", "prog": "AAP « Réacteurs nucléaires innovants » (France 2030)", "desc": "France 2030 support for project PROXIMA. Aid type: grant (subvention, Bpifrance). Confidence: high. Source quote: \"Chaque consortium se voit attribuer 10 M€ de subvention par l'Etat français…\"", "url": "https://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20240325849615/fr"}, {"org": "nuward", "name": "France 2030 – NUWARD", "body": "European Commission-approved State aid (France 2030)", "amt": 300000000, "d": "2024-04-26", "prog": "France 2030 – direct State aid (EC-approved)", "desc": "France 2030 support for project NUWARD. Aid type: direct grant (State aid approved by European Commission under RDI framework); separate from the AAP. Confidence: high. Source quote: \"Nuward ... a annoncé l'approbation de la Commission européenne de l'aide d'état de 300 millions d'euros…\"", "url": "https://www.sfen.org/rgn/la-commission-europeenne-valide-le-soutien-etatique-de-300-millions-deuros-a-nuward/"}]$j$) AS (org text, name text, body text, amt numeric, d text, prog text, "desc" text, url text))
INSERT INTO grants (id, organization_id, grant_name, granting_body, amount_eur, awarded_date, program, description, source_url, created_at, updated_at)
SELECT uuid_generate_v4(), o.id, s.name, s.body, s.amt, s.d::date, s.prog, s."desc", s.url, NOW(), NOW()
FROM s JOIN organizations o ON o.slug=s.org
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM grants g WHERE g.organization_id=o.id AND g.grant_name=s.name);

-- Naarea: receivership and court-ordered sale (press reports; BODACC not yet confirmed)
INSERT INTO organization_events (id, organization_id, event_type, event_date, title, description, source_url, source_type, source_name, verification_status, legacy_source, created_at, updated_at)
SELECT uuid_generate_v4(), o.id, e.t::event_type, e.d::date, e.title, e.descr, e.url, 'press', 'AFP via Connaissance des Énergies', 'medium', 'f2030_obj1_funding_november_2026', NOW(), NOW()
FROM organizations o, (VALUES
 ('other','2025-09-03','Naarea placed in receivership (redressement judiciaire)','Placed in receivership by the Nanterre commercial court after cash-flow problems; reported debt of about €15M. To confirm in BODACC.','https://www.connaissancedesenergies.org/afp/nucleaire-le-seul-candidat-la-reprise-de-la-start-naarea-se-desiste-260114'),
 ('acquisition','2026-01-16','Court orders sale of Naarea to Eneris','The Nanterre court ordered the sale of Naarea to the Eneris group although Eneris had announced it was withdrawing its offer. The company register still lists Naarea (SIREN 882949506) as active. To confirm in BODACC.','https://www.connaissancedesenergies.org/afp/nucleaire-le-groupe-eneris-contraint-par-la-justice-de-reprendre-naarea-malgre-lannonce-de-son-desistement-260116')
) e(t,d,title,descr,url)
WHERE o.slug='naarea' AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM organization_events x WHERE x.organization_id=o.id AND x.title=e.title);

SELECT (SELECT count(*) FROM project_links pl JOIN projects p ON p.id=pl.project_id WHERE p.slug LIKE 'france-2030-obj1-%' AND pl.role='lead') leads,
 (SELECT count(*) FROM grants WHERE grant_name LIKE 'France 2030 – %') grants,
 (SELECT sum(amount_eur) FROM grants WHERE grant_name LIKE 'France 2030 – %') total;
